# Recording of docs/public/gifs/hero.gif: run by scripts/docs_gifs.sh from the root of the repository.
Output docs/public/gifs/hero.gif
Source docs/gifs/settings.tape
Set Height 330
Hide
Type "cd build/docs-gifs/run/hero && export PATH=$PWD:$PATH PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "hero"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 9.5s
